<p>Asked to take a look at this via PM.</p>
<p>I'm moderately concerned about the length that you say your draft is. Reanimation and what lies beyond death aren't exactly new to the wiki, and the narrative of a doctor trying to get information out of them isn't exactly gripping — not to mention that all the build-up, to end with a crosslink to another SCP (is it dammerung?), seems like it wouldn't end well.</p>
<p>I haven't read your draft, but where possible I would suggest excising any repetitive/unnecessary content and investing a little more in the characters you have already, i.e. this main researcher and talking corpse. Having one or both of them have a satisfying arc by the end would probably elevate it a bit.</p>
<p>Can you indicate what the twist at the end is?</p>

