<p>Okay; from what you're describing this seems incredibly reliant on knowledge of DAMMERUNG to actually function as a story, which isn't particularly idea. SCPs are generally expected to stand on their own unless they're pulling from widely-accepted lore, which DAMMERUNG is not.</p>
