</blockquote>
<p>I see, thank you. I hadn't thought of it that way. To clarify: I never had any intention to piggyback of someone else's work. 2718 is one of my favourite SCPs, and during writing the draft, I thought it'd be a cool way to pay homage to it.</p>
<p>I really want to put my best foot forward here and contribute something decent to the site. Consequently, I'm going to do what you say and and have a rethink. Initially, I thought it'd be neat to have a link to DAMMERUNG at the end of the article in an &quot;Oh cool, this is connected!&quot; kind of way. Upon reflection (and with the help for you feedback), I guess it'd be kind of lame to have all this build up just for a crosslink. The last think I'd want is for people to feel frustrated and that they've wasted their time reading the article. Moreover, it should be able to stand on its own two feet.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>I personally would be more interested in the history of the Crystal and the<br />
entity inhabiting it, than tying this all to another SCP.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Okay, I'll take this on board. In retrospect, I suppose part of the big payoff just being a crosslink to another SCP would seem lazy to many on the site, and rightly so. I'm going to have a think, and then come back with some fresh ideas.</p>
<p>Thanks for all your feedback; I'll come back when I have something that's self-contained and doesn't rely on another SCP.</p>

