<p>I never had any intention to piggyback of someone else's work. 2718 is one of my favourite SCPs, and during writing the draft, I thought it'd be a cool way to pay homage to it.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It's not about what your intentions are, but how it will appear. Also paying homage to another skip as your first skip is a bad look. Make something your own and have the article stand on its own as much as you possibly can.</p>
